*3 [[Master A.|Master As]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 86.67~106.67 seconds<sup>2,600f~3,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage may seem harder than it actually is. First, stall the peons and get high damage using [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cats]]. When the main threats spawn, spam your damage dealers, but do not get hit by the Master As. Hit the base frequently to try and cheese this stage. Just remember to keep your attackers and meatshields going. Rushing the stage with fast units is also valid since enemies spawn on timers.

